 # Changelog
 
+## v1.2.19 — Shared Agent terminal, multi-terminal workspace and Git status context
+
+- Add an Agent Inspector `Terminal` tab while preserving the existing `Execução` event/log view as a separate tab.
+- Share interactive terminal state between Agent and Editor for the active Harness session, preserving cwd, history, output, target and draft input across mode switches.
+- Add multiple logical terminal tabs with independent state and a shared session Sandbox backend; Host remains explicitly confirmed per terminal.
+- Add bounded, exclusion-aware Git working-tree status to context manifests, the context ZIP and planner text, and include that metadata in the context fingerprint.
+- Add regression coverage for shared/multiple terminals and sanitized Git-status context.
+
