+
+The Agent inspector exposes a first-class **Terminal** tab distinct from **Execução**. The interactive terminal shown there and the terminal dock shown in Editor are two views over the same per-Harness-session terminal workspace, so switching between Agent and Editor preserves current tabs, cwd, command history, output, target selection and partially typed input.
